    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000szyr](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000szyr) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jul 13 2026 26km SW of Claveria. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 12.7858 longitude 123.043. It impacted 130952 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
